{"lines": [{"text": "Eighteen billion dollars. Zero dollars in income tax.", "start": 0.15, "end": 3.702, "spec": {"img": 1, "ov": "hook"}, "words": [["Eighteen", 0.08, 0.398], ["billion", 0.409, 0.693], ["dollars", 0.693, 1.25], ["Zero", 1.614, 1.898], ["dollars", 1.898, 2.273], ["in", 2.273, 2.341], ["income", 2.352, 2.693], ["tax", 2.693, 3.227]]}, {"text": "In 2011, this billionaire paid less income tax than a delivery driver. Totally legal. Here is the trick, in three steps.", "start": 4.002, "end": 13.218, "spec": {"img": 2, "ov": "driver"}, "words": [["In 2011", 0.08, 0.92], ["this", 1.284, 1.455], ["billionaire", 1.466, 2.023], ["paid", 2.023, 2.455], ["less", 2.773, 3.114], ["income", 3.193, 3.58], ["tax", 3.58, 3.989], ["than", 4.0, 4.091], ["a", 4.091, 4.136], ["delivery", 4.136, 4.477], ["driver", 4.489, 4.966], ["Totally", 5.33, 5.659], ["legal", 5.67, 6.102], ["Here", 6.489, 6.602], ["is", 6.943, 7.034], ["the", 7.034, 7.091], ["trick", 7.102, 7.523], ["in", 7.739, 7.909], ["three", 7.92, 8.295], ["steps", 8.307, 8.864]]}, {"text": "Step one: buy shares, and never sell them. No sale means no tax on the gains.", "start": 13.518, "end": 18.822, "spec": {"img": 3, "ov": "s1", "tr": "fade"}, "words": [["Step", 0.091, 0.341], ["one", 0.341, 0.591], ["buy", 1.023, 1.148], ["shares", 1.159, 1.716], ["and", 1.784, 1.898], ["never", 1.898, 2.08], ["sell", 2.091, 2.318], ["them", 2.318, 2.5], ["No", 2.864, 3.023], ["sale", 3.034, 3.42], ["means", 3.568, 3.773], ["no", 3.773, 3.966], ["tax", 3.966, 4.33], ["on", 4.33, 4.398], ["the", 4.409, 4.466], ["gains", 4.466, 4.977]]}, {"text": "Step two: borrow against them to pay for your life. A loan is not income, so it is not taxed.", "start": 19.122, "end": 25.194, "spec": {"img": 4, "ov": "s2", "tr": "fade"}, "words": [["Step", 0.091, 0.33], ["two", 0.341, 0.614], ["borrow", 1.091, 1.455], ["against", 1.455, 1.761], ["them", 1.761, 1.977], ["to", 2.091, 2.159], ["pay", 2.159, 2.477], ["for", 2.489, 2.614], ["your", 2